            "text": "A reasonable estimate is **about 500 million blinks in a lifetime**.\n\nQuick calculation:\n\n- Average blink rate while awake: **15\u201320 blinks per minute**\n- Awake time per day: about **16 hours**\n- Lifespan: about **80 years**\n\nUsing 15 blinks/minute:\n\n\\[\n15 \\times 60 \\times 16 \\times 365 \\times 80\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 420,480,000\n\\]\n\nUsing 20 blinks/minute:\n\n\\[\n20 \\times 60 \\times 16 \\times 365 \\times 80\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 560,640,000\n\\]\n\nSo the average human probably blinks roughly **400\u2013600 million times** over a lifetime, with **~500 million** as a solid midpoint estimate.",
